- Microsoft Qlib v0.9.7 (MIT)
  Alpha158 formula definitions and operator semantics are adapted into the
  existing factor engine with an explicitly different complete-window policy.
  Full copyright/license and pinned source: docs/licenses/qlib-MIT.txt.
  No code from the proprietary BenEcon/quant-platform project is incorporated.

- DolphinDBModules, commit 43ace2cc4b81d048864ec2e40c25728d5d464e05 (Apache-2.0)
  Reference author: DolphinDB; gtja191Alpha module last modified 2023-01-17.
  Selected GTJA191 mathematical calculations rewritten in NumPy/pandas with
